BlockStateInterface and IClientChunkProvider name the chunk holder by its base class ChunkSource instead of the client-only
ClientChunkCache. The host makes world.getChunkSource() implement IClientChunkProvider (createThreadSafeCopy returns a
non-blocking snapshot that is safe to read from the path-finding thread).

